I got micro:bit v2.21 worked.

procedures:
1. clone this repo
2. replace two platformio.ini with this repo's one.
3. pio run -v (project top)
4. pio run -v (under examples)
5. firmware.elf made
6. openocd + gdb -> file firmware.elf & load & continue
7. you get grin.

